# Defect 016's variant shape (panel 230's R2, M-panic-location step 10): an `assert`
# on two values of a variant wrote its expression and no side, until the sides were written as
# the specification writes the values, in the lldb formatter's notation and
# within its bounds. The line checked is the one that shows the shape.

variant Shape
    circle
        r: f64
    square
        side: i64
    none

function main()
    s: Shape = .circle(r: 2.5)
    t: Shape = .square(side: 4)
    assert s == t
